      "facts": [
        "LShape allocates independent zero position/size vectors; LLabel retains text. transformLabel copies source properties/origin and given size/position with no font/text measurement.",
        "Node/port/edge caller imports only non-NO_LAYOUT labels with nonempty text. Retain original JSON label objects outside the active work graph, including ignored labels.",
        "Core nodeLabels.placement defaults empty. Node geometry is copied back only when node or label has nonempty placement; no placement means original supplied label coordinates remain.",
        "Port labels transfer geometry unless node port-label placement is fixed; isFixed means neither INSIDE nor OUTSIDE selected, not merely an empty array spelling. Default OUTSIDE is active.",
        "Edge label CENTER/HEAD/TAIL sets real CENTER_LABELS or END_LABELS scheduling flags; edge transfer adds edgeOffset to work position. No dummy inserter/switcher or end-label implementation is inferred."
      ],
      "pendingDependencies": [
